Here's a simple function to convert snake_case to camelCase:

```javascript
function snakeToCamel(str) {
  return str.replace(/_([a-z])/g, (match, letter) => letter.toUpperCase());
}

// Examples
console.log(snakeToCamel("hello_world"));        // "helloWorld"
console.log(snakeToCamel("user_first_name"));    // "userFirstName"
console.log(snakeToCamel("already"));            // "already"
```

### How it works
- The regex `/_([a-z])/g` finds every underscore followed by a lowercase letter.
- The capture group `([a-z])` grabs that letter.
- The replacer function returns the captured letter in uppercase, dropping the underscore.

