# Retry Function for Throwing Callbacks

```javascript
/**
 * Retries a callback up to `maxRetries` times if it throws.
 *
 * @param {Function} callback - The function to execute. May throw.
 * @param {number} [maxRetries=3] - Maximum number of retry attempts.
 * @param {number} [delayMs=0] - Delay between retries (ms).
 * @returns {*} The return value of the callback on success.
 * @throws {Error} The last error if all attempts fail.
 */
function retry(callback, maxRetries = 3, delayMs = 0) {
